  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="7">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIIAtr">III Atr</ref> 7</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And gif hwa þeof clænsian wylle, lecge an C to wedde, healf landrican ⁊ healf cinges gerefan binnan port, ⁊ gange to þrimfealdan ordale.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if anyone seeks to clear a thief, he shall deposit 100 [of silver] as security, half with the lord of the manor and half with the king's town-reeve and he shall go to the triple ordeal.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Et si quis furem innoxiare uelit, ponat unum hundretum in uadio, dimidium tunc domino, dimidium preposito regis intra portum, et adeat triplex ordalium.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
